Title: Ferry
Credit: exportado pelo easyscript

# dialogue/ferry.dialogue

## CAPTAIN

.BOARDING - THE DECK

[[The captain greets the player. Keep it short.]]

@THE CAPTAIN
(happy)
Welcome aboard!

@DECKHAND
(tired)
Tickets, please.

@THE CAPTAIN ^
(happy)
Don't mind him.

!The engines rumble.

!— O jogador escolhe:

!— "Show the ticket" (só se has_flag("ticket"))

@DECKHAND
(tired)
All good.

[[do set_flag("boarded")]]

!— "Sneak past"

@THE CAPTAIN
(angry, pensando)
I saw that!

!→ CAUGHT

!— "Leave"

!→ Fim.

!— (fim das escolhas)

!— Se has_flag("boarded"):

@THE CAPTAIN
Enjoy the trip, {{player_name}}.

!— Senão:

@THE CAPTAIN
Hm/Well, suit yourself.

!— (fim)

!→ CROSSING

.CAUGHT - THE DECK

@THE CAPTAIN
(angry)
Off my *boat*.

!→ Fim da conversa.

.CROSSING - THE DECK

!— Uma destas, ao acaso:

!— 1.

@GULL
Squawk.

!— 2. (peso 2)

@GULL
Squawk squawk.

!— (fim)

!— Quando weather() for "storm":

@THE CAPTAIN
(angry)
Hold on!

!— Senão:

@THE CAPTAIN
(calm)
Smooth sailing.

!— (fim)

[[set crossed = true]]

!→ Fim.
